graphy and street-art visual style from <Picture 1>, featuring large bold Chinese characters in colored blocks, brush-stroke edges, glitch accents, analog grain texture, left-right side panel layout, REC timestamp overlay, footprint graphics on the ground, and dynamic motion lines.\n<Subject 3> is the urban Chinese street environment — a city street blending modern skyscrapers with traditional Chinese architectural elements like pagoda roofs, red lanterns, and ink-wash mountain silhouettes in the background.\n<Audio 1> is the vocal and instrumental reference for the Chinese rap performance, providing the female rapper's voice timbre, flow, beat rhythm, and Chinese lyrics with \"CG迷\" as the subject.\n<Picture 1> is the sole performer and style reference for <Subject 1> and <Subject 2>, defining the rapper's appearance, fashion, flat-vector illustration style, typography layout, color palette, and overall MV aesthetic.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation + audio reference] The target video is a 16:9 kinetic lyric performance MV in a flat-vector street-art style with Chinese rap aesthetics. Typography is the main event while <Subject 1> — the female rapper \"CG迷\" — serves as the visual anchor at the center. The 12-second video features four synchronized Chinese lyric lines with progressive energy, using bold blocky Chinese typography, ink-brush accents, glitch effects, and collision motion, all rendered in the high-saturation flat-vector style of <Picture 1>. <Audio 1> provides the vocal timbre, beat timing, and lyrics centered on \"CG迷\".\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in all shots): fully_preserved - the female rapper's long braided ponytail, oversized pink sunglasses, gold hoops, gold chain, purple sports bra, dark blue cargo jacket, gray cargo pants, sneakers, microphone, and confident powerful stance are fully retained; Chinese-style jade pendant and embroidered sleeve details are added to the outfit for the guofeng theme.\n<Subject 2> (appears in all shots): fully_preserved - the large bold block typography, left-right side panel layout, REC timestamp overlay, footprint graphics, analog grain texture, and high-saturation flat-vector style are fully retained; Chinese calligraphic brush edges and seal-stamp accents are added to the typography.\n<Subject 3> (appears in all shots): partially_preserved - the urban street setting is retained from <Picture 1>, with traditional Chinese elements (red lanterns, pagoda rooflines, ink-wash mountains) blended into the background for the guofeng rap theme.\n<Audio 1>: reference - the target video follows <Audio 1>'s female vocal timbre, rap flow, beat rhythm, and Chinese lyrics with \"CG迷\" subject without copying the original signal.\n<Picture 1> (performer + style reference): fully_preserved - provides complete character design, flat-vector illustration style, typography layout, color palette, and MV aesthetic direction.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video uses a flat-vector street-art illustration style with high-saturation colors — purple, pink, orange, red, and gold — with Chinese ink-brush accents and analog grain texture throughout. The composition centers on the rapper with large typography panels on the left and right sides, REC overlay in the bottom-left corner, and dynamic footprint/arrow graphics on the street ground.\n\n[Shot 1] A low-angle dynamic medium shot of <Subject 1>, the female rapper with long braided ponytail, oversized pink sunglasses, gold hoops, gold chain, purple sports bra under dark blue cargo jacket with embroidered cloud patterns on the cuffs, gray cargo pants, and white sneakers, holding a microphone close to her mouth. She walks forward powerfully down the street with a confident swagger, her braid swinging. On the left side of the frame, massive bold typography blocks slam in from off-screen with collision motion — <d>[Chinese] CG迷 登场</d> — in white characters on a black brush-stroke background with red accents, \"CG迷\" glowing with electric-pink highlight. On the right side, <d>[Chinese] 像素生风</d> bursts in orange and gold with pixelated edges, particles flying outward. Footprint graphics appear on the ground in sync with her steps. The background shows a city street blending modern buildings with traditional Chinese rooflines and red lanterns. The REC indicator flickers in the bottom-left corner showing \"00:00:00.00\".\n\n[Shot 2] At 00:03.000, a sharp cut on the beat. The camera pushes in to a tighter medium shot of <Subject 1> as she raises her free hand and gestures with the beat. Her expression is fierce and energetic behind the pink sunglasses. The left typography panel updates — <d>[Chinese] 建模山河</d> — in bold gold characters on a deep purple background, with wireframe mountain graphics forming behind the text like a 3D model being built. The right panel shows <d>[Chinese] 渲染苍穹</d> in gradient orange-to-red characters with ink-wash cloud effects swirling around them. The text pulses and scales with each drum hit. Traditional ink-wash mountains appear in the distant background, blending with the city skyline. The REC timestamp reads \"00:03:00.00\".\n\n[Shot 3] At 00:06.000, another sharp cut. The energy ramps up. The camera angle shifts to a dynamic Dutch angle medium shot of <Subject 1> leaning into the mic, her body rocking with the rhythm. Her braid flies with the motion. The left panel — <d>[Chinese] 千年国风</d> — appears in red seal-script style characters stamped onto the frame, with ancient scroll patterns and oracle-bone symbols flickering behind them. The right panel — <d>[Chinese] 数字交融</d> — explodes in electric blue and gold, with binary code rain and circuit-board patterns radiating outward. The two typography panels collide in the middle briefly, creating a glitch burst where ink and pixels merge. The background becomes more abstract, with floating lanterns and digital particles mixing together. The REC timestamp reads \"00:06:00.00\".\n\n[Shot 4] At 00:09.000, the final climactic cut. The camera pulls back to a full wide shot of <Subject 1> striking a power pose at center frame, mic raised high, her entire body radiating energy. The left and right typography panels expand to fill more of the frame. Left side: <d>[Chinese] 虚实之间</d> in massive white characters on a black brush-stroke block, with dragon-scale texture and glowing particle trails. Right side: <d>[Chinese] 谁与争锋</d> in giant red and gold characters with a giant red seal stamp slamming down beside them on the final beat. The typography reaches maximum scale and impact. <Subject 1> is at the peak of her performance, surrounded by swirling ink and digital particles. The background fully blends traditional Chinese mountains with digital cityscapes. The video ends on maximum energy — the text fully readable, the rapper locked in a powerful pose, and a final burst of ink splatter and pixel explosion on the last beat. The REC timestamp reads \"00:11:999\".\n\noverall_soundscape:\nThe primary vocal layer is <Audio 1>'s female Chinese rap vocal with beat. Layered sound design includes heavy 808 drum hits, brush-stroke whooshes with digital glitch tails, seal-stamp impacts, crowd-ad-lib energy, subtle guzheng plucks mixed with synth arpeggios, and vinyl crackle texture that accents the lyric transitions and typography motion.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\n<Audio 1> provides the complete instrumental and vocal track — a Chinese-style hip-hop beat with guzheng, pipa, 808 bass, and electronic synth elements at an energetic tempo, driving the visual rhythm and lyric sync from start to finish, blending traditional Chinese instruments with modern trap production."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Input Text (Prompt)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [370, 390], "pos": [-1482.4295654296875, 6004.85888671875], "id": 138, "properties": {"cnr_id": "c